{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">西環域多利道有私家車與電單車相撞，電單車司機受傷昏迷送院。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.TA.WD-0100_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026JliOZryb7t1790892468.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.TA.WD-0100_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">涉事的電單車翻側在路旁，司機頭盔損毀，留有血迹。涉事的私家車車頭刮花，車牌剝落，私家車司機登上警車協助調查。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.TA.WD-0100_002.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026bm0itpoH8z1790892465.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.TA.WD-0100_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">昨晚十時半左右警方接報，指域多利道168號對開近摩星嶺徑交界，一輛私家車及一輛電單車相撞。60多歲電單車男司機當場昏迷，由救護車送往瑪麗醫院搶救。意外起因仍有待調查。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.TA.WD-0100_003.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026JJOsdXtuVk1790892462.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.TA.WD-0100_003.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-01T22:38:25.216722+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":168,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}